Rips_CancelRip
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the rip does not exist
    │   └── it should revert.
    ├── when the rip is sold out
    │   └── it should revert.
    ├── when the rip is awaiting randomness
    │   └── it should revert.
    ├── when the rip is already cancelled
    │   └── it should revert.
    └── when the rip is filling
        ├── it should mark the rip as cancelled.
        ├── it should emit a {RipCancelled} event.
        ├── it should let an entrant refund.
        ├── it should reject further entries into the cancelled rip.
        ├── it should create a fresh rip on the current config for the next entry.
        └── when the protocol is paused
            └── it should still cancel.
